---
{{ frontmatter }}---

{#
  The app owns what sits between each "%% mc:begin NAME %%" and its "%% mc:end NAME %%" line. A
  rerun replaces those blocks and keeps everything outside them. A custom template must keep the
  markers, one per line, or a rerun on an edited note cannot place its blocks.
#}
%% mc:begin details %%
# {{ title }}

- **When:** {{ when }}
{% if huddle %}
- **Slack huddle:** {{ huddle.place }}, {{ huddle.duration }}
{% if huddle.captions_warning %}
- **Captions:** {{ huddle.captions_warning }}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if meeting_url %}
- **Meeting URL:** {{ meeting_url }}
{% endif %}
{% if attendees %}

## Attendees

{% for attendee in attendees %}
- {{ attendee }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
%% mc:end details %%

%% mc:begin recording %%
{% if recording %}
## Recording

{% if recording.video_url %}
- [Video]({{ recording.video_url }}) ({{ recording.video_length }})
{% elif recording.video_purged_on %}
- Video: purged {{ recording.video_purged_on }} (audio kept)
{% endif %}
{% for part in recording.parts %}
- {% if part.label %}{{ part.label }}: {% endif %}{% if part.mic_url %}[My mic]({{ part.mic_url }}){% endif %}{% if part.mic_url and part.remote_url %} · {% endif %}{% if part.remote_url %}[Remote]({{ part.remote_url }}){% endif %}

{% endfor %}
- [Call folder]({{ recording.folder_url }})
{% endif %}
%% mc:end recording %%

%% mc:begin summary %%
{% if notes %}
## Summary

{{ notes.summary }}
{% endif %}
%% mc:end summary %%

%% mc:begin decisions %%
{% if notes and notes.decisions %}
## Decisions

{% for decision in notes.decisions %}
- {{ decision.text }} {{ decision.links }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
%% mc:end decisions %%

%% mc:begin action-items %%
{% if notes and notes.action_items %}
## Action items

{% for item in notes.action_items %}
- {% if item.owner %}**{{ item.owner }}:** {% endif %}{{ item.text }}{% if item.due %} (due {{ item.due }}){% endif %} {{ item.links }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
%% mc:end action-items %%

%% mc:begin open-questions %%
{% if notes and notes.open_questions %}
## Open questions

{% for question in notes.open_questions %}
- {{ question.text }} {{ question.links }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
%% mc:end open-questions %%

%% mc:begin my-commitments %%
{% if notes and notes.my_commitments %}
## My commitments

{% for commitment in notes.my_commitments %}
- [ ] {% if commitment.strength != "committed" %}({{ commitment.strength }}) {% endif %}{{ commitment.text }}{% if commitment.recipient %}, for {{ commitment.recipient }}{% endif %}{% if commitment.due %}, by {{ commitment.due }}{% endif %} {{ commitment.links }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
%% mc:end my-commitments %%

%% mc:begin caption-fixes %%
{% if notes and notes.caption_fixes and shows_caption_fixes %}
## Possible caption errors

The notes above read these words as the guess shown. Check them against the call.

{% for fix in notes.caption_fixes %}
- "{{ fix.heard }}" {% if fix.is_unsure %}may have meant{% else %}probably meant{% endif %} "{{ fix.likely }}" {{ fix.links }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
%% mc:end caption-fixes %%

%% mc:begin transcript %%
## Transcript

{% if transcription %}
_{{ transcription }}_

{% endif %}
{% for segment in segments %}
**[{{ segment.at }}] {{ segment.speaker }}:** {{ segment.text }} ^s{{ segment.id }}

{% endfor %}
{% if chat_messages %}
## Chat

{% for message in chat_messages %}
**[{{ message.at }}] {{ message.sender }}:** {{ message.text }}

{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
%% mc:end transcript %%
